Title: OAuth 2 flow - Token Revocation

participant Resource Owner
participant Client
participant Authorization Server

Resource Owner->Client: Logout
Client->Authorization Server: Revoke token
Note right of Client: POST /o/revoke_token\nData:\ntoken: <access_token>\nclient_id: <client_id>\n*For confidential client\nclient_secret: <client_secret>
Authorization Server-->Client: Token revoked (200 OK)
Client-->Resource Owner: Logged out